r the 2020 Stock Incentive Plan (as amended, the &#8220;2020 Plan&#8221;), the Company was authorized to issue shares of common stock to the Company&#8217;s employees, officers, directors, consultants and advisors in the form of options, restricted stock awards or other stock-based awards.</span></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:6pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-style:italic;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">2021 Stock Incentive Plan</span></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:6pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">In September 2021, the Company&#8217;s board of directors and stockholders adopted the 2021 Stock Incentive Plan (the &#8220;2021 Plan&#8221;), which became effective immediately prior to the Company&#8217;s initial public offering of common stock (&#8220;IPO&#8221;) in October 2021. Upon effectiveness of the 2021 Plan, the Company ceased granting awards under the 2020 Plan. The 2021 Plan provides for the grant of incentive stock options, nonstatutory stock options, stock appreciation rights, restricted stock awards, restricted stock units and other stock-based awards. The Company initially reserved </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_3c1f0d9d-026f-4f45-bc35-49a53dedced5" contextRef="C_0c43e734-c762-4dad-bb20-dbd1161ad849" name="us-gaap:CommonStockCapitalSharesReservedForFutureIssuance" unitRef="U_shares" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">469,929</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> shares of common stock under the 2021 Plan. The 2021 Plan provides that the number of shares reserved and available for issuance under the 2021 Plan will be cumulatively increased on January 1 of each calendar year by </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_a63efb41-14db-4b87-b1c3-3229adbc149b" contextRef="C_fba0d9bb-c399-4874-8538-bd4ffaea859c" name="xlo:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardIncreaseInNumberOfSharesReservedAndAvailableForIssuancePercentage" unitRef="U_pure" scale="-2" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">5</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">% </span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">of the number of shares of common stock outstanding on such date or such lesser amount determined by the</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </span></p></ix:nonNumeric></div></div>
